    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We often feel anxious and burned out from our fast-paced, over-stimulated lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover peace and tranquility with Wanderness, a new type of walking sim that takes you through serene natural landscapes. As you wander, capture stunning moments with your trusty camera and immerse yourself in a soothing, zen-inspired world that calms your mind and eases anxiety. Reconnect with the beauty of nature and find your center, one peaceful step at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a stunning world crafted from real 360-degree photographs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing and uplifting soundscape that transports you to serenity and coziness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No timers, no crafting, and no pressure. Just wander and capture photos at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a full day cycle as the landscape gracefully transforms from dawn to dusk and into night.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We often feel anxious and burned out from our fast-paced, over-stimulated lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover peace and tranquility with Wanderness, a new type of walking sim that takes you through serene natural landscapes. As you wander, capture stunning moments with your trusty camera and immerse yourself in a soothing, zen-inspired world that calms your mind and eases anxiety. Reconnect with the beauty of nature and find your center, one peaceful step at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a stunning world crafted from real 360-degree photographs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing and uplifting soundscape that transports you to serenity and coziness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No timers, no crafting, and no pressure. Just wander and capture photos at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a full day cycle as the landscape gracefully transforms from dawn to dusk and into night.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
